WEBVTT

00:00:58.659 --> 00:01:01.206
and had gone to every expert
to find out why.

00:01:01.779 --> 00:01:03.068
No one could tell me.

00:01:03.444 --> 00:01:05.944
And then, out of the blue,

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:09.515
some physician's assistant
called me at work

00:01:09.539 --> 00:01:12.328
to tell me that I had stage IV cancer,

00:01:12.352 --> 00:01:15.400
and that I was going to need
to come to the hospital right away.

00:01:16.239 --> 00:01:19.245
And all I could think of to say was,

00:01:19.269 --> 00:01:20.789
"But I have a son.

00:01:21.945 --> 00:01:23.919
I can't end.

00:01:23.943 --> 00:01:26.225
This world can't end.

00:01:26.249 --> 00:01:28.479
It has just begun."

00:01:29.458 --> 00:01:32.101
And then I called my husband,
and he rushed to find me